{"id":"7eacc656-d37d-4ad3-9964-88ecb51a96ef","rule_id":"6f024bde-7085-489b-8250-5957efdf1caf","name":"【默认】Windows系统账户修改活动目录组","immutable":true,"rule_source":{"type":"external","is_customized":true,"customized_fields":[{"field_name":"name"},{"field_name":"description"},{"field_name":"note"},{"field_name":"tags"},{"field_name":"false_positives"},{"field_name":"setup"},{"field_name":"investigation_fields"}],"has_base_version":true},"version":109,"revision":4,"updated_at":"2026-09-15T06:09:05.989Z","updated_by":"elastic","created_at":"2026-09-15T02:32:15.433Z","created_by":"elastic","enabled":true,"interval":"5m","from":"now-9m","to":"now","description":"检测 SYSTEM 上下文修改 AD 组。对应需求：群组成员变更 / 特权审计。","tags":["操作系统: Windows","主题: 身份安全","来源: 默认","对应需求: 群组成员变更"],"author":["Elastic"],"license":"Elastic License v2","threat":[{"framework":"MITRE ATT&CK","tactic":{"id":"TA0003","name":"Persistence","reference":"https://attack.mitre.org/tactics/TA0003/"},"technique":[{"id":"T1098","name":"Account Manipulation","reference":"https://attack.mitre.org/techniques/T1098/"}]},{"framework":"MITRE ATT&CK","tactic":{"id":"TA0004","name":"Privilege Escalation","reference":"https://attack.mitre.org/tactics/TA0004/"},"technique":[{"id":"T1098","name":"Account Manipulation","reference":"https://attack.mitre.org/techniques/T1098/"}]}],"investigation_fields":{"field_names":["@timestamp","host.name","winlog.computer_name","user.name","user.id","source.ip","event.code","winlog.event_id","event.action","event.outcome","winlog.event_data.TargetUserName","winlog.event_data.SubjectUserName","winlog.event_data.MemberName","message","event.original"]},"related_integrations":[{"package":"system","version":">=2.0.0"},{"package":"windows","version":">=3.0.0"}],"required_fields":[{"name":"event.code","type":"keyword","ecs":true},{"name":"group.id","type":"keyword","ecs":true},{"name":"host.os.type","type":"keyword","ecs":true},{"name":"winlog.event_data.SubjectUserSid","type":"keyword","ecs":false}],"setup":"## 设置说明\n\n需要 Windows/域控安全日志（Winlogbeat 或 Agent Windows 集成）。部分规则依赖活动目录相关事件。\n","note":"## 调查指引\n\n请结合 Windows 安全事件字段：`user.name`、`source.ip`、`host.name`、`event.code`、`winlog.event_data.*`。\n\n### 响应建议\n1. 确认是否授权。\n2. 无授权则遏制账号并溯源。\n3. 关联同用户的登录失败、组变更、GPO 变更。\n","false_positives":["变更窗口内的合法管理操作","基线学习期的机器学习误报"],"references":[],"risk_score":47,"risk_score_mapping":[],"severity":"medium","severity_mapping":[],"timestamp_override":"event.ingested","output_index":"","max_signals":100,"exceptions_list":[],"actions":[],"type":"eql","language":"eql","index":["logs-system.security*","logs-windows.forwarded*","winlogbeat-*"],"query":"iam where host.os.type == \"windows\" and event.code == \"4728\" and\nwinlog.event_data.SubjectUserSid : \"S-1-5-18\" and\n\n/* DOMAIN_USERS and local groups */\nnot group.id : \"S-1-5-21-*-513\"\n"}
